(cherry picked from commit 665b1fc2a1845206408f9a2c6da67101789edb82)
[ adapted `p->uf_bo` to the pre-drm_exec field spelling `p->uf_entry.tv.bo` ]
Signed-off-by: Sasha Levin <sashal@kernel.org>
